        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/CoastalTown/_scene_octopus.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 0dfaea51-3c36-4722-9eff-f1e7ef139878).Image",
        "Description": "In the serene, cobbled streets of Sapienza, an unlikely enforcer of justice emerges—a magnificent, yet mysterious horse known only as &quot;47.&quot; This majestic creature, under the guise of a celestial messenger, has become the feared instrument of a zealous religious order determined to cleanse the city of corruption and sin.\r\rThe order, known as the &quot;Order of the Sacred Gallop,&quot; believes 47 to be divinely chosen. With each clop of his hooves, he brings a message of divine retribution.",
